Put Display settings on the desktop menu.

The resolution dialog, likeos-display-settings, lists the sizes the screen
can be set to and sets the one picked -- at once where the display driver
can switch, at the next start where the screen is the boot framebuffer.  The
desktop's right-click menu is where it is reached from, next to "Desktop
Preferences", the other entry about how the desktop looks.

